@template dreamy
// One of the ten voice templates (the head writer, with social B). Its words match section 20c's VOICE_FALLBACK, so
// baking it changes nothing; the template's own lines (content/templates/dreamy.lines) come in wave 2.
talk: Wandering, soft, notices odd lovely things; loses the thread.
hi: Oh, hello there | Hi
bye: Mind the stars | See you around
yes: Mm, why not | I suppose so
thanks: That's kind
wow: Oh, how lovely
sigh: Ah, well
nick: - | - | - | friend | friend
needs: share
